  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.11.0: Major performance optimization release. Keccak/SHA-3 fully unrolled (now at parity with BouncyCastle). BLAKE2b/2s AVX2/SSSE3 vector loading. RIPEMD-128/320 fully unrolled. xxHash one-shot API (at parity with System.IO.Hashing). SHA-512/256 ReadOnlySpan K constants. CRC-32C SSE4.2 hardware acceleration. HighwayHash safe refactor (no unsafe code). 20 algorithms faster than reference, only 2 slower. VeryLargeFile benchmarks (10MB-1GB). 1853+ tests passing.",
